  "logoutFailed": "Could not log out. Please try again.",
  "productModerationTitle": "Product moderation",
  "productModerationSubtitle": "Review images that need human approval",
  "termsAccountTitle": "1. Accounts and security",
  "termsAccountBody": "You may browse listings as a guest. Creating an account or using account features requires sign-in through one of the methods available in the app: email and password, Google or Apple. Provide accurate information, protect your login details, and never share your password or recovery codes. You are responsible for activity through your account and should notify us if you suspect unauthorised use.",
  "termsListingsTitle": "2. Products and listings",
  "termsListingsBody": "List only products you own or are legally authorised to offer. Photos, descriptions, prices and condition must be accurate and current. Clearly disclose material defects, missing parts and repairs. Stolen, counterfeit or prohibited goods, misleading images and content infringing third-party or intellectual-property rights are prohibited.",
  "termsSellerTitle": "3. Seller responsibilities",
  "termsSellerBody": "The seller is responsible for the right to offer the product and for the accuracy of its details, photos, price and condition, and must honour the agreement with the buyer. A seller whose activity is professional or commercial and qualifies them as a supplier or trader must meet applicable licensing, disclosure, commercial, tax and consumer-protection duties. The role label used in the app does not by itself determine legal status.",
  "termsBuyerTitle": "4. Buyer responsibilities",
  "termsBuyerBody": "Review the listing, photos, price and condition, and ask questions before agreeing. Keep a copy of the listing, messages and evidence of the agreement, payment or delivery. Do not assume that every genuine private sale between individuals automatically carries the statutory withdrawal rights applicable to supplier-consumer distance contracts. Mandatory legal rights cannot be waived.",
  "termsDeliveryTitle": "5. Delivery and shipping",
  "termsDeliveryBody": "In phase one, do not assume Kenza arranges or guarantees shipping. Buyer and seller should agree on the delivery method, place, timing, cost and each party’s responsibilities before contracting. If Platform-managed shipping is introduced later, its provider, coverage, cost and terms will be clearly displayed before use.",
  "termsPaymentTitle": "6. Prices and payments",
  "termsPaymentBody": "The seller sets the product price, and any additional cost should be agreed before the transaction. Phase one does not provide in-app collection, a wallet, escrow, a protection fee or refunds administered by Kenza. Do not send money to anyone claiming to represent the Platform, and never share card details, passwords or verification codes.",
  "termsPrivacyTitle": "7. Privacy and data",
  "termsPrivacyBody": "Account, profile, listing, image and message data are processed under the Privacy Policy and applicable Egyptian law. Do not publish contact details, addresses or private documents in public content, and do not access or use another member’s data without a lawful basis.",
  "termsConductTitle": "8. Conduct and prohibited content",
  "termsConductBody": "Fraud, impersonation, harassment, threats, listing or price manipulation, unlawful or misleading content, infringement of third-party rights, attempts to access or disrupt the app without authorisation, and unlawful use of the Platform are prohibited. Content or accounts may be restricted following a violation or credible report, subject to applicable law and the user’s opportunity to provide an explanation.",
  "termsPlatformTitle": "9. Kenza's role and service limits",
  "termsPlatformBody": "Kenza is an electronic marketplace that lets members list and discover products and communicate. The Platform does not become the owner or seller of a product merely because a member lists it; the sale agreement is between seller and buyer. These terms do not exclude any legal duty that may apply to the Platform operator, and do not release a professional seller from supplier or trader obligations.",
  "termsChangesTitle": "10. Changes to these terms",
  "termsChangesBody": "These terms identify the current version and last-updated date. They may change as the service or legal requirements evolve, and the updated version will be shown in the app. Where a material change requires renewed acceptance by law or by its nature, we will request it before the relevant feature is used. Mandatory legal rights are not affected.",
  "privacyIntro": "This policy explains the personal data Kenza may process, the purposes of processing, and how data is protected, retained and accessed. It is drafted for the phase-one product design with reference to Egyptian Personal Data Protection Law No. 151 of 2020 and Executive Regulations No. 816 of 2025. Applicable licences, permits and legal consents must still be obtained before operations where required.",
  "privacyDataTitle": "1. Information we handle",
  "privacyDataBody": "We may process basic account data such as display name, email address and the sign-in method you choose; profile details; listing content such as photos, descriptions, prices and categories; messages and reports you submit; and limited technical and security logs needed to operate and protect the service. We seek only data needed for the stated purpose. Do not include sensitive information in listings or chats.",
  "privacyUseTitle": "2. How information is used",
  "privacyUseBody": "Data is used to create and manage accounts, authenticate sign-ins, enable browsing and publishing/editing/deleting listings, operate search and available communication features, respond to support requests and reports, protect accounts and systems, prevent fraud and meet legal obligations. We will not use data for an incompatible new purpose without a lawful basis and any required consent.",
  "privacyAiReviewTitle": "3. Automated product image review",
  "privacyAiReviewBody": "When you upload product photos, the photos and related listing information (title and description) are sent from Kenza servers to Google Gemini to analyse image clarity, suitability for listing, and prohibited content or goods. This review is not used to identify people. A listing is published only after its photos pass review; if the review cannot be completed or the result is uncertain, the listing remains unpublished. Google processes the submitted content under its own terms and privacy policies. These disclosures, including data transfers and processing locations, must be reviewed for legal compliance before public launch.",
  "privacyPhoneTitle": "4. Sign-in and verification data",
  "privacyPhoneBody": "Phase one supports sign-in with email and password, Google or Apple. Phase one does not generally require a phone number or SMS one-time password (OTP) to create an account. If additional sign-in data is introduced later, we will explain the data and purpose before enabling the feature.",
  "privacyVisibilityTitle": "5. Who can access your information",
  "privacyVisibilityBody": "Login credentials, email addresses and private account data are not publicly displayed. Your display name and the listing content you choose to publish may be visible. Store employees must not access buyers’ private personal data merely because they are employees; access is limited according to assigned tasks. Administrators may access only information needed for a report, dispute, security incident or legal obligation, with access logging where supported.",
  "privacyMessagesTitle": "6. Messages",
  "privacyMessagesBody": "Messages enable communication between members and may be retained as conversation history to provide the service and address reports or disputes. Under the service design, neither participant can delete the other participant’s conversation history from their own account. Administrators must review messages only for a legitimate operational reason such as a report, dispute, misuse or legal request.",
  "privacyOrderDataTitle": "7. Order contact and delivery information",
  "privacyOrderDataBody": "Phase one does not assume that Kenza operates an order, shipping or payment service. If additional data fields are introduced later to fulfil a transaction or delivery, we will explain the required data, purpose, recipients and retention period before enabling the feature.",
  "privacyRetentionTitle": "8. Retention and deletion",
  "privacyRetentionBody": "Each category of data is retained only for as long as needed for its purpose, subject to legal obligations, dispute handling and system security. Account data may remain necessary while an account is active; specific records or evidence may be retained for a period required by law or a pending claim. There is no single retention period for all data. A separate schedule must be defined for each category and secure deletion applied when the purpose ends.",
  "privacySecurityTitle": "9. Data protection",
  "privacySecurityBody": "We use technical and organisational controls intended to reduce unauthorised access, protect accounts and data, and limit permissions according to need. No electronic transmission or storage method is completely secure. Protect your sign-in details and report unusual activity. Data incidents are handled under the reporting and notification procedures required by law.",
  "privacyChangesTitle": "10. Changes to this privacy policy",
  "privacyChangesBody": "This policy may be updated when app features, processed data or legal requirements change. We will display the latest version and effective date, and request renewed consent where legally required. The final notice must identify the legal data controller, its address, a privacy-rights request channel and the Data Protection Officer where appointment is required.",
  "privacyDraftNotice": "Phase-one review draft, not a final privacy notice or proof of regulatory compliance. Before public release, add the controller’s legal name and address, contact details and rights-request channel; identify the Data Protection Officer where required; verify licences/permits, processing locations and cross-border transfers; and obtain review by Egyptian counsel.",
